@startuml
hide footbox
title Global Error Handling (Tech) - AllExceptionsFilter flow

actor PrimaryActor as "System"
participant API as "API"
participant Router as "Router"
participant Controller as "Controller"
participant Service as "Service"
participant ExceptionFilter as "ExceptionFilter"
database DB as "Database"

activate PrimaryActor
PrimaryActor -> API: (1) Incoming request (any route)
activate API
API -> Router: (2) Route dispatch to controller
activate Router
Router -> Controller: (3) Controller action executes (may throw)
activate Controller
alt (3.1) controller throws HttpError or DatabaseError
  Controller --> ExceptionFilter: (3.1.1) thrown error (HttpError | DatabaseError | Error)
  deactivate Controller
  ExceptionFilter -> DB: (3.1.2) write to error.log (error details, stack, path, timestamp)
  activate DB
  DB --> ExceptionFilter: (3.1.3) write result
  deactivate DB
  ExceptionFilter -> API: (3.1.4) formattedResponse { statusCode, message, timestamp, path }
  deactivate ExceptionFilter
  API --> PrimaryActor: (3.1.5) HTTP Response { statusCode, body }
else (3.2) success
  Controller --> Router: (3.2.1) return data
  deactivate Controller
  Router --> API: (3.2.2) success response
  API --> PrimaryActor: (3.2.3) response
end
deactivate Router
deactivate API
@enduml

